    },
    "body": "found we can optimize `CastToBool` used by IFDUP, VERIFY while reviewing #36721.\n\nCurrently the loop checks one byte at a time, instead we can process one word of 8 bytes at a time.\n\nFor the worst case scenario of one-tx-block with a script `<520-byte stack element> [IFDUP VERIFY] repeated`, with the element being 519 zero bytes + 0x01: \n\nthe benchamrk shows 3.1x speedup (from ~922ms to ~295ms)\n\nMaster at  https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/a527a0077a0fcae913188410214efe98021c0cca:\n\n\n|           ns/script |            script/s |    err% |     total | benchmark\n|--------------------:|--------------------:|--------:|----------:|:----------\n|      922,608,458.00 |                1.08 |    1.3% |     10.21 | `VerifyIfDupVerifyFullLast`\n\n\nThis PR :\n|           ns/script |            script/s |    err% |     total | benchmark\n|--------------------:|--------------------:|--------:|----------:|:----------\n|      295,193,916.00 |                3.39 |    1.5% |      3.31 | `VerifyIfDupVerifyFullLast`",
