        "payload": "tree 488647be758e06c634ae7a65ac05890e9c94a1ac\nparent a527a0077a0fcae913188410214efe98021c0cca\nauthor jrakibi <j.errakibi@gmail.com> 1794739676 +0800\ncommitter jrakibi <j.errakibi@gmail.com> 1794739676 +0800\n\nscript: (optimization) scan CastToBool in 64-bit chunks\n\nWe can optimize `CastToBool` used by IFDUP, VERIFY.\nCurrently the loop checks one byte at a time, instead we can process\none word of 8 bytes at a time.\n\nFor the worst case scenario of one-tx-block with a script\n`<520-byte stack element> [IFDUP VERIFY]` repeated, with the element\nbeing 519 zero bytes + 0x01: the benchamrk shows 3.1x speedup (from ~922ms to ~295ms)\n\nMaster:\n\n|           ns/script |            script/s |    err% |     total | benchmark\n|--------------------:|--------------------:|--------:|----------:|:----------\n|      922,608,458.00 |                1.08 |    1.3% |     10.21 | `VerifyIfDupVerifyFullLast`\n\nThis PR \n|           ns/script |            script/s |    err% |     total | benchmark\n|--------------------:|--------------------:|--------:|----------:|:----------\n|      295,193,916.00 |                3.39 |    1.5% |      3.31 | `VerifyIfDupVerifyFullLast`\n",
